@startuml

title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Prediction & Patient Dashboard Sequence</b></size>\n<size:12>Result Storage, Analytics and Clinical Report Flow</size>

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 160

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    ActorBorderColor #334155
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorFontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center


participant "Flask REST API" as API #E0F2FE
participant "DatabaseManager" as DBManager #DCFCE7
database "SQLite\nvoxflow_local.db" as DB #ECFDF5
participant "Streamlit\nDashboard" as UI #EDE9FE
actor "Patient / User" as Patient #DBEAFE
actor "Speech Therapist" as Therapist #FEF3C7


== Prediction Storage ==

API -> DBManager : savePrediction(...)
DBManager -> DB : INSERT prediction
DB --> DBManager : Prediction stored
DBManager --> API : Saved successfully


== Patient Dashboard ==

Patient -> UI : Open dashboard
UI -> DB : Query patient\nprediction history
DB --> UI : Sessions + predictions

UI --> Patient : Display latest result,\nhistory and fluency trends


== Clinical Report ==

Patient -> UI : Generate clinical report
UI -> DB : Retrieve selected\nsession records
DB --> UI : Session data

UI --> Patient : Report / CSV export
Patient -> Therapist : Share report during\nclinical consultation

@enduml